        "notes": "**POWERS:** Despite the description of Inner Peace, I have found that its Harmony Orb does more healing than Dual Harmony's second orb. However, if you find yourself not receiving much damage, I would suggest going with Dual Harmony.\n\nI include Gotta Have Faith as an optional, but I would never actually select this unless you have someone you really want to pocket for 5 seconds.\n\n**ITEMS:** The goal is to get as much healing as possible to help with getting money early on. After you use Transcendence, you'll gain even more Ability Power, so try to use your ultimate as soon as possible. If your team doesn't need it, go for a flank with it.",
