        "notes": "**ITEMS:** Continue using Ability Power to maximize healing and, in turn, cash generation. I don't have it displayed here, but you could also opt to get items meant for a traditional Zenyatta damage build and earn cash by just getting kills/damage.\n\nIncluded in the Optional category is Satya's Solution. This is a great item later on, and if you have the money for it then by all means, but Custom Stock gives you that extra damage that you'll be lacking.",
