        "notes": "This round is where the build's vision truly begins.\n\n**POWERS:** Soul Control is the crux of this build, allowing you to cancel your Transcendence and preserve some ult charge. Every situation you've wanted to use Transcendence for, you can, and now for often less ult charge.\n\n**ITEMS:** Catalytic Crystal will help you get your Transcendence significantly faster. Included in the Optional category is Mondatta's Mantra, which increases the duration of Transcendence. This item is best thought of as an ult charge discount. By default, you have about 1.5 seconds of Transcendence without going below 75% ult charge remaining, but Mondatta's Mantra increases that to 2 seconds.\n\nThe reason I list it as Optional and not important (yet) is due to the lack of Ability Power for such an expensive upgrade. I prefer to wait until Round 4 before getting this upgrade.",
