        "created_at": "2025-07-25T22:49:29.25238+00:00",
        "notes": "**ITEMS:** This is when you'll really want to have Mondatta's Mantra alongside Catalytic Crystal. Your team should take things slowly in the early game, allowing you to build that ult charge and getting your first Transcendence, which you should theoretically get MUCH faster with your retained ult charge.\n\nIncluded in the Optional category is Mind Shaper. It pairs alongside this build well with great buffs, but I prefer Satya's Solution to this - the extra movement speed with Transcendence plus the range increase feel so better to use, plus the idea is to use as little of your Transcendence as possible unless you really really need it.",
